# Layers

| Layer | Role | Must not |
|-------|------|----------|
| API | HTTP glue, permissions, call service/selector, envelope | Business rules, ORM writes |
| Serializer | Validate/shape HTTP in/out | `save()`, services, queries |
| Selector | Reads (`get_*` / `list_*`) | Writes, HTTP |
| Service | Writes (`data=` TypedDict → `model_create`/`update`/`save`) | HTTP, serializer.save() |
| Validator | `is_*` pure + `*Validator` raisers | ORM side effects beyond checks |

- Keyword-only: `def foo(*, …)`.
- Uniqueness: DB constraint + `map_integrity_error` — not serializer-only.
- Changing layer contracts → update **this rule file** (+ `AGENTS.md` hard dos) in the **same** change.

